        "tier": "scheduled",
        "defaultTier": "scheduled",
        "reason": ".github/workflows/nightly.yml runs on schedule (02:17 UTC) and workflow_dispatch. docs/DEPLOYING.md says a grading defect reaches learners within 24 hours, and B-001 is critical, so a nightly live run is justified. Runs the local stub, so no model calls and no extra secret."
